*   Doom/Heretic -> Duke3D Level Converter   *
DMDKCONV  V1.30 (960901) converts Doom I/II
and Heretic Levels to Duke Nukem 3D Levels.
Now allows you to run Duke3D with the original 
DOOM II textures (DOOM II required for this).
This is great !  Download now !  Freeware.
